      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "D-Comp Orchestrator is an event-driven coordination system for many bounded workers contributing to one durable game. Read this section in order to move from the decompilation model through the machine, game boundary, durable state, workflow phases, and shared knowledge system."
        }
